OL,3,GNEWSAApology letters sent after
OL,4,Ahospital data breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo hospital workers who were sacked
OL,7,Ffor inappropriately accessing a woman's
OL,8,Fmedical notes sent apology letters to
OL,9,Fher family, police said.
OL,11,FCambridge University Hospitals
OL,12,Fconfirmed three staff members were
OL,13,Fdismissed for looking up medical
OL,14,Finformation about Gemma Sabatino.
OL,16,FThe mother and hairdresser, from Red
OL,17,FLodge, Suffolk, died aged 36 in June
OL,18,F2025, after being treated for multiple
OL,19,Finjuries and later breast cancer at
OL,20,FAddenbrooke's Hospital.
