OL,3,GNEWSAApology letters sent after
OL,4,Ahospital data breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FCambridgeshire Police said it
OL,7,Finterviewed three people under caution
OL,8,Ffor accessing the data; one person
OL,9,Ffaced no further action and two were
OL,10,Fgiven a community resolutions, which
OL,11,Fincluded writing apology letters.
